    Dry run (validate only, no deploy):
      sf project deploy start `
        --manifest manifest/native-loi-psa/package.xml `
        --post-destructive-changes manifest/native-loi-psa/destructiveChangesPost.xml `
        --target-org usman-dpeg `
        --test-level RunSpecifiedTests `
        --tests DispositionStageEntryServiceTest --tests DispositionOfferSelectorTest `
        --dry-run --wait 60

    Then the real deploy: the same command with --dry-run removed.

